flowchart TD

    Start((Start))
    Planned[Planned]:::todo
    AtRisk[At Risk]:::inprogress
    Achieved[Achieved]:::done

    Start --> |Create| Planned
    Planned --> |Flag At Risk| AtRisk
    Planned --> |Achieve| Achieved
    AtRisk --> |Resolve Risk| Planned

    classDef todo fill:#EBEDF0,stroke:#C0C1C2,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef inprogress fill:#EAE6FF,stroke:#403294,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef done fill:#E3FCEF,stroke:#006644,stroke-width:2px;